/ <%# locals: (filter:) -%>

/ Switch between the periods of an event list, keeping all other filters.
.btn-group.btn-group-sm.period-switch(role="group" aria-label="Zeitraum")
  - AdminFilterHelper::EVENT_PERIODS.each do |label, value, hint|
    - active = filter.upcoming_or_past == value
    = link_to label, admin_event_period_path(filter, value),
              class: ["btn", (active ? "btn-primary active" : "btn-outline-primary")],
              title: hint,
              "aria-current": ("true" if active)
